meta {
  name: Regenerate recovery codes
  type: http
  seq: 13
}

post {
  url: {{host}}/api/auth/2fa/recovery-codes/regenerate
  body: json
  auth: inherit
}

headers {
  Content-Type: application/json
}

body:json {
  {
    "code": "000000"
  }
}

docs {
  UC-40. Authenticated.

  Invalidates every existing recovery code, including unused ones, and issues ten new ones, each XXXX-XXXX-XXXX-XXXX. This is also how codes of the older XXXX-XXXX shape are replaced by the stronger ones. Send either code or recoveryCode. A wrong one answers 401 "The password or code is incorrect.".

  Revokes every token the person holds, this one included: keep the codes, then sign in again.
}
